## KGSL Allocation Shim (Source Withheld)

**Component:** `libkgslshim.so`
**Binary location:** `app/src/main/jniLibs/<abi>/libkgslshim.so`
**Source location in repo:** intentionally absent (maintained in a separate
  private repository, not committed here)
**Authorship:** Written from scratch by the GameNative maintainers. Not derived
